        <detaileddescription>
<para>Number of antenna paths supported by the local controller for the CS tone exchanges. The number of antenna paths used during the phase measurement stage of the CS step.<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Range:</bold> 1 to 4</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Value: 0. Phase measurement does not occur during the CS step, therefore ignored </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
